assertion  XSH.labs.001
anchor     functions/labs.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/labs.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
says       labs(i) returns i for i equal to 0, 1, 5, 123456 and LONG_MAX.
test       t/001-labs-nonneg.c

assertion  XSH.labs.002
anchor     functions/labs.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/labs.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
says       labs(i) returns -i for i equal to -1, -5, -123456 and -LONG_MAX.
test       t/002-labs-negative.c

assertion  XSH.labs.003
anchor     functions/labs.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/labs.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
since      2001
says       llabs(i) returns i for i equal to 0, 1, 5000000000 and LLONG_MAX.
test       t/003-llabs-nonneg.c

assertion  XSH.labs.004
anchor     functions/labs.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/labs.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
since      2001
says       llabs(i) returns -i for i equal to -1, -5000000000 and -LLONG_MAX.
test       t/004-llabs-negative.c
